{"title":"2021 GMC 12B Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_GMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> be two legs of a right triangle with hypotenuse <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Find the greatest possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/a/8aa9a4508e0097c6cc925362260370e2e96f3bfa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^3+a^2b+ab^2+b^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"147\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/6/4160f6b57a75ba5b8883d0494c5cbbe420680eae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)} ~4\\sqrt{2}+2 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)} ~4\\sqrt{3}+4 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)} ~8\\sqrt{2} \\qquad\\textbf{(D)} ~6\\sqrt{3} \\qquad\\textbf{(E)} ~12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"517\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_GMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>To maximize <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/a/8aa9a4508e0097c6cc925362260370e2e96f3bfa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^3+a^2b+ab^2+b^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"147\" height=\"16\" /> is to maximize <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/1/2510c0ee8fa65393d9a6689e806595cd57234ea2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = a$\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />. Applying the Pythagorean Theorem, we get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/3/ef37ceee606824755f9e9ceb2e3882736b0c30ae.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} a^2 + b^2 &amp;= 4 \\\\ 2a^2 &amp;= 4 \\\\ a^2 &amp;= 2 \\\\ a &amp;= \\sqrt2. \\end{align*}\" width=\"106\" height=\"102\" />\n</p><p>Evaluating <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/a/8aa9a4508e0097c6cc925362260370e2e96f3bfa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^3+a^2b+ab^2+b^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"147\" height=\"16\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/f/c4f6570b709e738d0b7dda08a387d65fbabb24ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}~8\\sqrt2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"81\" height=\"35\" />.\n</p><p>~pineconee\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017134647\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.006 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.006 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 51/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2323/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:22581:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017134647 and revision id 172401. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}